### ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Customer API — list (GET /api/v1/customers) — chain admin only
#
# How to run: VS Code REST Client — click "Send Request" top to bottom
# (captures feed the next requests; never re-type values by hand).
#
# Prerequisites:
#   - Docker stack rebuilt with the Customer module: docker compose up -d --build
#   - Seeded chain admin exists: admin@devtunde.com / Password123!
#
# `# Expected:` labels the status code each request proves.
# The list is newest-first: the latest enroll appears at index 0.
# Re-run note: literal phones re-enroll idempotently (200) if already present.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@chainAdminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
@userToken = {{probeLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 1. Chain admin logs in
# @name adminLogin
# Expected: 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@devtunde.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 2. Enroll shopper A
# @name enrollA
# Expected: 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{chainAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "List Shopper Alpha",
  "phone": "+2348095050505"
}

### 3. Enroll shopper B (a moment later — B must sit above A)
# @name enrollB
# Expected: 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{chainAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "List Shopper Beta",
  "phone": "+2348096060606"
}

### 4. Chain admin lists: newest first — B above A
# Expected: 200 — index 0 is "List Shopper Beta", A appears below B
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{chainAdminToken}}

### 5. Mint a regular persona for the gate probe
# @name probeSignup
# Expected: 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Probe Persona {{$timestamp}}",
  "email": "probe.list{{$timestamp}}@example.com",
  "phone": "+2348031110004",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 6. Regular persona logs in
# @name probeLogin
# Expected: 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{probeSignup.response.body.user.email}}",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 7. Regular user: the full list is chain-admin-only: 403
# Expected: 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 8. Anonymous caller: 401
# Expected: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers

### 9. Enroll shopper C — newest entry for the order re-check
# @name enrollC
# Expected: 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{chainAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "List Shopper Gamma",
  "phone": "+2348097070707"
}

### 10. Chain admin lists again: Gamma now at index 0, Beta above Alpha
# Expected: 200 — newest-first ordering preserved with 3 probe shoppers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{chainAdminToken}}
